==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Red Malice]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns.
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Red Malice shouldn't be too much trouble due to his large amount of knockbacks. Bring any high-level [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] for Red Malice and the peons, some [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] for the Metal Hippoes, a few hard-hitting Cats for ranged damage, and 2 or 3 meatshields for your front line.

